<li><a name="n4" id="n4"></a>See &ldquo;Recent  Decisions of the Federal Open Market Committee: A Bridge to Fiscal Sanity?&rdquo;  speech by Richard W. Fisher, Nov. 8, 2010,  <a href="../2010/fs101108.cfm">www.dallasfed.org/news/speeches/fisher/2010/fs101108.cfm</a>.</li>
<li><a name="n5" id="n5"></a>See &ldquo;Trichet Urges Budget-Cutting,&rdquo; by  Brian Blackstone, <em>Wall Street Journal</em>,  Jan. 8, 2011, <a href="http://online.wsj.com/article/SB10001424052748704739504576067352757709020.html">http://online.wsj.com/article/SB10001424052748704739504576067352757709020.html</a>.</li>
