<li><a name="n8" id="n8"></a>See &ldquo;Many  Small Businesses Hiring Fewer Workers Than Needed,&rdquo; by Dennis Jacobe, Wells  Fargo/Gallup Small Business Index, Feb. 4, 2011, <a href="http://www.gallup.com/poll/145946/small-businesses-hiring-fewer-workers-needed.aspx">www.gallup.com/poll/145946/small-businesses-hiring-fewer-workers-needed.aspx</a>.</li>
